            <div xml:id="d773">

                <pb facs="1049" n="929" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg929"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77/2850: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Former President of the Technical Board</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Stevens</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Harbin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-11-23T16:00:00+08:26"><hi rendition="#italic">November 23,
                                1922—4 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 4:47 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am leaving to-day for Peking on first lap of going to the United States.
                    Secretary of Technical Board will remain short time to close up details. Any
                    instructions should be sent to Harbin in my name which if necessary will reach
                    me Peking through the secretary who retains code.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stevens</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
